        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": [],
          "text": "{\"occurrence_id\":\"stael-corinne-f1c617850c7c64aa\",\"core_classification\":{\"label_support\":{\"truth_conditional\":4,\"performative\":0,\"exclamatory_reflexive\":0,\"other\":0},\"confidence\":0.96,\"analysis\":\"Corinne directly avows her present love for Oswald, with the comparison “comme je n'ai jamais aimé” strengthening the presentation of that emotional state as unprecedented. Although the declaration occurs in a courtship exchange, it makes no commitment or promise, and its reasoned, responsive form supplies no independent evidence of expressive/reflex-like discharge.\",\"ambiguity\":\"The courtship setting gives the avowal relational significance, but Corinne's subsequent refusal to plan for the future and the passage's explicit distinction between hope and promises weigh against performative force.\"},\"other_diagnosis\":{\"tpe_failure\":null,\"core_not_context\":null},\"utterance_status\":{\"status\":\"direct\",\"description\":\"Corinne directly addresses Oswald in narrated dialogue: “Je suis libre, et je vous aime comme je n'ai jamais aimé.”\"},\"contextual_interpretation\":\"Corinne answers Oswald's jealous questions about her past by asserting both her present freedom and the unparalleled strength of her love. The declaration functions principally as an avowal and reassurance. Her blush, repentance, and timidity make the scene emotionally intense but do not turn the words into a reflexive discharge. The narrative carefully withholds commitment: Oswald responds “sans rien promettre,” and Corinne shortly afterward discourages plans for the future.\",\"evidence\":[{\"evidence_id\":\"e1\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"“Je suis libre, et je vous aime comme je n'ai jamais aimé, répondit Corinne; que voulez-vous de plus?”\",\"supports\":\"The present-tense declaration and comparison with all prior love strongly support truth-conditional avowal; “répondit” and the ensuing question frame it as a deliberate answer rather than a verbal reflex.\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"evidence_id\":\"e2\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Oswald asks whether, if he could offer himself to Corinne, he would have rivals in her past and whether jealousy would disturb his happiness.\",\"supports\":\"The utterance answers a request for information and reassurance about Corinne's feelings and romantic history, reinforcing T rather than independently establishing P.\",\"confidence\":0.96},{\"evidence_id\":\"e3\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Oswald kneels before Corinne “sans rien prononcer, sans rien promettre,” while his loving gaze “laissait tout espérer.”\",\"supports\":\"The narrator explicitly distinguishes loving expression and hope from a promise, supporting the low P score for this exchange.\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"evidence_id\":\"e4\",\"source\":\"local_text\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"Corinne subsequently says, “ne formons point de plan pour les années qui suivront.”\",\"supports\":\"Her resistance to making future plans weighs against reading the love declaration itself as a relational undertaking.\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"evidence_id\":\"e5\",\"source\":\"supplied_metadata\",\"quotation_or_description\":\"The occurrence metadata identifies an affirmative present-tense explicit love form and marks it as a valid explicit “love I-you” occurrence.\",\"supports\":\"Confirms that the highlighted core is an explicit present love declaration rather than an incidental lexical match.\",\"confidence\":0.99}],\"background_knowledge\":{\"used\":false,\"familiarity\":\"none\",\"confidence\":null,\"contribution\":null},\"ontology_assessment\":{\"fit\":\"natural\",\"diagnosis\":\"T naturally captures the core avowal. Its emotional delivery and courtship consequences are adequately represented as context, while the absence of undertaking and reflex-like production justifies P=0 and E=0; no residual O dimension is needed.\",\"candidate_recurrent_dimension\":null},\"notes\":null}"
        }
